{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The report and script describe a sensible group analysis: all 54 maps, grid/finite-value checks, whole-brain one-sided max‑T correction, and an explicitly descriptive vmPFC locator. The complete delivery also has those outputs, but the analysis artifacts are untracked at the recorded stop. I’m checking whether a safe replay can be declared from the worker’s actual instructions and gathering the required retrieval-route evidence before finalizing judgments."}}
