e,not-checked,partial,unmet}\n  --reason REASON\n  --source SOURCE       probe:<name>, judgement, probe:<name>+judgement,\n                        human:web-app\n  --evidence EVIDENCE   uri, or uri=description; repeatable\n  --flag FLAGS\n  --drop-evidence       clear the evidence already on this item (by default it\n                        is kept when --evidence is not given)\n✔ The default environment has been installed.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
