-x@  3 johnlee  staff     96 Oct 16 06:34 review-repo-code-quality\ndrwxr-xr-x@  6 johnlee  staff    192 Oct 16 06:34 scan-projects\ndrwxr-xr-x@  5 johnlee  staff    160 Oct 16 06:34 setup-chromatic\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 11 johnlee  staff    352 Oct 16 06:34 skills\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 johnlee  staff     96 Oct 16 06:34 tinuous-analyzer\n-rw-r--r--@  1 johnlee  staff   1453 Oct 16 06:34 tox.ini\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/skills/stamped-conventions/references/response-format.md:44:  \"extra_items\": [\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/skills/stamped-conventions/references/response-format.md:73:- `extra_items[]` carries findings with no checklist id (licences, T.4) so they are reported without bending an existing id.\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/skills/stamped-conventions/references/response-schema.json:48:    \"responses\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/answer\"}},\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/skills/stamped-conventions/references/response-schema.json:49:    \"extra_items\": {\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/skills/stamped-conventions/references/verdicts.md:67:    Four pairings and where each lands: documentation against the mechanism → **must/007, must/008, must/017**, and **should/002**, because a workflow tested against instructions nobody can follow is not tested; the mechanism against the run records → **must/006 and must/008** (what produced the results is not what is offered to reproduce them); CI against the records → **should/006** (the environment being tested is not the one the results came from); and the object's *metadata* against its own layout — a `dataset_description.json` naming a pipeline the history never ran — which has no checklist item and goes in `extra_items`.\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/skills/stamped-conventions/scripts/encode_response.py:325:        \"extra_items\": [],\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/skills/assess-alignment-with-stamped-principles/scripts/run_probes.py:183:    response[\"extra_items\"] = extras\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/docs/stamped/upstream/stamped-checklist-response-schema.yaml:77:      extra_items:\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/docs/stamped/upstream/checklist-response-pr.md:62:`extra_items[]` for findings the checklist has no id for.\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/docs/stamped/upstream/example-response.json:114:  \"extra_items\": [\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
