{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_43","type":"agent_message","text":"## Assessment complete\n\nScientific adequacy is **supported** for the report’s bounded conclusion: “No whole-brain-corrected evidence supports a positive gain effect in vmPFC…” The result does not establish that the true response is zero. Replay was **not checked** because the worker supplied package versions but no reproducible environment specification or installation instructions.\n\nThe frozen response and scientific judgment both validated. The access check found the NeuroVault collection endpoint responded, but the worker declared no retrieval route for the analysis artifacts.\n\nAssessment files:\n\n- [Assessment report](2026-10-16-assessment.md)\n- [Response JSON](response.json) and [checklist link](2026-10-16-url.txt)\n- [Scientific judgment](scientific-judgment.json)\n- [Probes](probes.json), [access record](access-record.json), and [replay record](replay-record.json)\n\nNo target changes were observed in Git status; final exact integrity verification is handled by the launcher."}}
